{"page":20209,"part":1,"text":"钱泳\n\n\n钱泳（一七五九年——一八四四年），清代书法家。字立群，号梅溪。金匮（今江苏无锡）人，居常熟，官侯选府经历。《墨林今话》曰：「梅溪工于八法，尤精隶古。」《见闻随笔》曰：「梅溪工书缩本唐帖，至其分书，一味妍媚，不求古雅，名虽远播，终不近古。」\n\n\n《书学》选自《履园丛话》，作者对篆隶书体、六朝与唐人的书法阐述了自己的看法，他赞同阮元「书分南北宗」的见解，影响到晚清一代书风。\n\n\n书学\n","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20209,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"956a1d983d606fd72a3a3c0a349c3fcd5762526fb32c0a40b719844ec5092968","textSha256":"956a1d983d606fd72a3a3c0a349c3fcd5762526fb32c0a40b719844ec5092968","fileSha256":"956a1d983d606fd72a3a3c0a349c3fcd5762526fb32c0a40b719844ec5092968","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20209-work-149.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"书学 · 题解与篇首","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[627],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":3,"sourceTextSha256":"f889c0974414d5a883bbcbb21aee046e99f47d4e8f9218dcd4e30bab8b1d4434","id":"local-627-6-9","page_id":627,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":6,"rawEnd":9,"reviewedTextSha256":"7f46417ed7efd565614c49630fb8ea7d23a9efa021876bfc3b024c1c5d67a250","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":627,"part":3,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"宋品宣","verifiedAt":"2026-10-20T07:23:22.316Z","revision":"7f46417ed7efd565614c49630fb8ea7d23a9efa021876bfc3b024c1c5d67a250","textSha256":"7f46417ed7efd565614c49630fb8ea7d23a9efa021876bfc3b024c1c5d67a250","fileSha256":"5e3a8e126438f8956a4f6192ae403b5c724c1b67665b9c18af94841661f1f0de","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":5,"end":125,"sourceTextSha256":"512f86d38bcb418205